{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"shepherd|strong=\"H7462\";  \nI|strong=\"H3808\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"lack|strong=\"H2637\"nothing|strong=\"H3808\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"He|strong=\"H5921\"makes me|strong=\"H5921\"lie|strong=\"H7257\"down|strong=\"H7257\"in|strong=\"H5921\"green|strong=\"H1877\"pastures|strong=\"H4999\".  \nHe|strong=\"H5921\"leads|strong=\"H5095\"me|strong=\"H5921\"beside|strong=\"H5921\"still|strong=\"H4496\"waters|strong=\"H4325\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"He|strong=\"H5315\"restores|strong=\"H7725\"my|strong=\"H7725\"soul|strong=\"H5315\".  \nHe|strong=\"H5315\"guides|strong=\"H5148\"me|strong=\"H5315\"in|strong=\"H5315\"the|strong=\"H7725\"paths|strong=\"H4570\"of|strong=\"H8034\"righteousness|strong=\"H6664\"for|strong=\"H8034\"his|strong=\"H7725\"name|strong=\"H8034\"’s sake|strong=\"H4616\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Even|strong=\"H1571\"though|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"walk|strong=\"H3212\"through|strong=\"H3212\"the|strong=\"H3588\"valley|strong=\"H1516\"of|strong=\"H7626\"the|strong=\"H3588\"shadow|strong=\"H6757\"of|strong=\"H7626\"death|strong=\"H6757\",  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H1571\"fear|strong=\"H3372\"no|strong=\"H3808\"evil|strong=\"H7451\", for|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H1992\"with|strong=\"H3212\"me|strong=\"H5978\".  \nYour|strong=\"H3588\"rod|strong=\"H7626\"and|strong=\"H3212\"your|strong=\"H3588\"staff|strong=\"H4938\",  \nthey|strong=\"H1992\"comfort|strong=\"H5162\"me|strong=\"H5978\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"You|strong=\"H6440\"prepare|strong=\"H6186\"a|strong=\"H3068\"table|strong=\"H7979\"before|strong=\"H6440\"me|strong=\"H6440\"in|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"presence|strong=\"H6440\"of|strong=\"H7218\"my|strong=\"H6440\"enemies|strong=\"H6887\".  \nYou|strong=\"H6440\"anoint my|strong=\"H6440\"head|strong=\"H7218\"with|strong=\"H6440\"oil|strong=\"H8081\".  \nMy|strong=\"H6440\"cup